---
description: Kotlin / Jetpack Compose rules
globs: ["android/**/*.kt", "android/**/*.kts"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Material 3. State in ViewModels as StateFlow, no logic in composables.
- Manual DI via `AppContainer`, no Hilt.
- Logic in `domain/` with JUnit tests in `app/src/test/`.
- Run `./gradlew testDebugUnitTest assembleDebug` in `android/` after changes.
